data: {"id": "eca37142daab4c6b-thinking-parallel_evidence-663", "run_id": "eca37142daab4c6b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我将基于已有的 Metrics、Logging、Tracing 证据（OOMKilled, 内存线性增长, trace observed_mode=oom_growth），结合 kubectl_get_yaml 和 kubectl_previous_logs 的结果，完成根因证据采集。\n\n**关键事实汇总：**\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`CrashLoopBackOff`, restarts=23, exitCode=137, Ready=False\n2. **Metrics**：`last_terminated_reason=OOMKilled`, `restarts_total=23`\n3. **Logging**：内存每2秒增长2 MiB，从 2 MiB 线性增至 48 MiB；trace 中 `observed_mode=oom_growth`\n4. **kubectl_get_yaml**：exitCode=137 (对应 OOM Killed 信号 9), containersNotReady\n5. **kubectl_previous_logs**：前一次崩溃前日志", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788456350148, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

